# Archetype Orchestrator — Cline Rules

## Task Lifecycle
- Pre-work:  `bash archetype-orchestrator/scripts/pre-work-check.sh`
- Post-work: `bash archetype-orchestrator/scripts/post-work-check.sh`
- Always work on feature branches

## Spec Discovery
- Scan:  `python archetype-orchestrator/engine/discover.py --scan`
- Route: `python archetype-orchestrator/engine/discover.py --query "keywords"`
- Read the matched constitution before working

## Validation
- `bash archetype-orchestrator/scripts/validate.sh`

## Context
- Read `docs/planning/CONTEXT_CHECKPOINTS.md` at session start
- Write: `bash archetype-orchestrator/scripts/context-checkpoint.sh "milestone"`

## Planning Documents (docs/planning/)
- DUAL_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md
- CONTEXT_LOOP.md
- RALPH_LOOP.md
- SOURCE_CONSULTATION_MAP.md
